# ==============================================================================
# Novel-to-Movie AI - Root Environment Reference
# ==============================================================================
# The FastAPI backend reads configuration from `backend/.env`.
# Copy `backend/.env.example` to `backend/.env`:
#
#   copy backend\.env.example backend\.env
#
# Then fill in your API key:
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# PROVIDER_MODE=free_tier
#
# Refer to backend/.env.example for all available settings and descriptions.
